# docs/photos-source/ IS tracked (see import_media): the hosting platform
# used for client review (Render free tier) has no persistent disk, so the
# source photos need to travel with the repo/Docker image for every
# container boot to re-import them. One exception, kept out of the repo:
# a third party's brand is visible in it, see import_media.py for why it's
# not in the IMAGES list.
